      "content": "I know, i've talked to people. They just say \"hang in there\" or \"it gets better,\" but they don't get it. It's not about being sad, it's just... there's nothing left to do. I'm just taking up space and waiting for the clock to run out. It feels like I'm just watching life happen from the sidelines and I can't even get back in the game.",
